  Definition |
  TimeTopologyComplex |
  Polygon |
  RectifiedGrid |
  CompoundCRS |
  DynamicFeatureCollection |
  Style |
  TimeCalendar |
  CompositeSurface |
  Dictionary |
  MultiPoint |
  EnvelopeWithTimePeriod |
  GeodeticDatum |
  Node |
  BaseUnit |
  DirectedObservation |
  TimeNode |
  CompositeSolid |
  GeodeticCRS |
  DirectedObservationAtDistance |
  DerivedUnit |
  LineStringSegment |
  TimeEdge |
  LinearRing |
  MultiCurve |
  Ellipsoid |
  FeatureStyle |
  Edge |
  DataBlock |
  EllipsoidalCS |
  ConventionalUnit |
  TimeInstant |
  ArcString |
  TimeClock |
  CompositeValue |
  MultiSurface |
  CartesianCS |
  Envelope |
  VerticalCRS |
  Face |
  TimePeriod |
  File |
  default_style.Arc |
  ValueArray |
  TimeOrdinalReferenceSystem |
  VerticalCS |
  PrimeMeridian |
  CategoryExtent |
  MultiSolid |
  ConcatenatedOperation |
  CoverageFunction |
  ProjectedCRS |
  Circle |
  TimeCS |
  QuantityExtent |
  Point |
  ArcStringByBulge |
  GeometryStyle |
  TopoSolid |
  EngineeringDatum |
  MappingRule |
  LinearCS |
  GridFunction |
  PassThroughOperation |
  ImageDatum |
  DerivedCRS |
  ArcByBulge |
  UserDefinedCS |
  VerticalDatum |
  SphericalCS |
  Conversion |
  TopologyStyle |
  ArcByCenterPoint |
  CodeOrNilReasonList |
  EngineeringCRS |
  TemporalDatum |
  PolarCS |
  TemporalCS |
  LineString |
  MeasureOrNilReasonList |
  CylindricalCS |
  Transformation |
  CircleByCenterPoint |
  LabelStyle |
  AffineCS |
  CubicSpline |
  ImageCRS |
  ObliqueCartesianCS |
  ParameterValue |
  BSpline |
  TopoComplex |
  GraphStyle |
  TemporalCRS |
  ParameterValueGroup |
  Bezier |
  OperationMethod |
  OffsetCurve |
  AffinePlacement |
  Clothoid |
  GeographicCRS |
  GeodesicString |
  OperationParameter |
  GeocentricCRS |
  Geodesic |
  Surface |
  OperationParameterGroup |
  OrientableSurface |
  Ring |
  Bag |
  Array |
  Tin |
  GenericMetaData |
  Solid |
  Shell |
  FeatureCollection |
  DefinitionProxy |
  MovingObjectStatus

/// The abstract element gml:AbstractGML is "any GML object having identity".   It acts as the head of an XML Schema substitution group, which may include any element which is a GML feature, or other object, with identity.  This is used as a variable in content models in GML core and application schemas.  It is effectively an abstract superclass for all GML objects.
union AbstractGMLChoice =
  Curve |
  GeometricComplex |
  TimeReferenceSystem |
  Grid |
